SHOE CARE
Before the first wear, we recommend a thorough application of protective spray and repeating regularly. Waterproofing helps protect the surface against moisture and dirt, preserves the color, and prolongs the lifespan of your shoes.&nbsp; 

 Clean gently with a soft brush or damp cloth.

 Always let your shoes dry naturally, away from direct heat sources.

 Do not machine wash.

 Give your shoes the care they deserve with our recommended care products.&nbsp;
